{
  "_about": "What stands in for each FNV/FO3 form, by category, keyed by the source EditorID. use: 'Plugin|EditorID'. as: item (that record itself), stats (a copy with the source's name and stats), fnv (the source's own mesh). mods: OMOD EditorIDs replacing a gun's default parts at the same attach points. _rules: what forms the table leaves out get (creatures by skeleton folder, NPC bodies, armor by biped slot, melee weapons by animation type). A profile (--profile) and then a user file (--replacements) of the same shape are laid over this one entry by entry. See docs/fork/fo4_replacements.md and docs/fork/fo4_gui.md#replacement-data.",

